@startuml
participant "客户端" as Client
participant "monthsLine方法" as Method
participant "monthMapper" as Mapper
participant "BookAnalysis.WordCloud" as WordCloud

Client -> Method : monthsLine(bookId)
Method -> Mapper : monthsLine(bookId)
activate Mapper
Mapper --> Method : 返回List<WordCloud>
deactivate Mapper

Method -> Mapper : clicksPie(bookId)
activate Mapper
Mapper --> Method : 返回List<WordCloud>
deactivate Mapper

Method -> Mapper : recommondsPie(bookId)
activate Mapper
Mapper --> Method : 返回List<WordCloud>
deactivate Mapper

Method -> Method : 处理数据
Method --> Client : 返回新的BookAnalysis
@enduml
